WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:12.540
Getting rekt is quite possibly the worst thing
that can happen to you in a game of CS:GO.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.060
Trust me on this one guys, it happens a
lot when I play.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.770
I mean you guys know how it is, right?

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:23.140
You’re holding tight in ladder room, ready
to headshot anyone STUPID enough to challenge you,

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:28.500
and then Oskar flies down ladder with
an AWP and destroys you on the off-angle you

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.320
thought was perfect.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.280
Feels bad.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.060
(Casting)

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.520
Or all you want is your fifteen minutes of
fame, and well, this happens.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.680
"I would like to thanks..."

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:45.620
I’m Colin for theScore esports, and this
week on Best of, we’re talking about the

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:48.540
best “get rekt” moments from CS:GO.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:52.050
Now what does it mean to get wrecked or to
do the wrecking?

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:57.600
Well, it’s about hitting that perfect pixel
peak, it’s about nailing someone with a

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.780
dirty jump shot, or getting that double kill
collateral.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:02.660
Just watch.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:11.100
(Casting)

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.000
"Rekt."

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.200
(Casting)

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.080
"Gotcha b**ch."

00:01:21.080 --> 00:04:22.800
(Casting)

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:26.680
You know guys, sometimes get rekt plays go the other way too.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:29.560
You’re sneaking up behind someone ready to knife him in the back

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:33.720
and he turns around and kindly removes your head from your body.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:45.920
(Casting)

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.280
"How embarrassing, how embarrassing."

00:04:50.280 --> 00:05:27.440
(Casting)

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:30.340
"Aw man, poor kid."

00:05:30.340 --> 00:06:57.340
(Casting)

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:01.420
Finally guys, we make it to my personal favourite part of the video,

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:08.100
you know getting rekt isn’t just confined to the virtual world. Sometimes you can get rekt IRL too.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:14.240
"Thank you for asking me. First of all, I would like to congratulation for the enemy team, FaZe Clan."

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:18.940
"They worked really hard. It was a good feeling for us, and I would like to thanks-"

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:25.360
"I would like to thanks all of the people who supported with us, it was very wonderful."

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.780
"Well the stage has hit a set here. You know the two teams that walked up,

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.900
there is a bit of a spice in the step of both teams there."

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.900
"James and Dan looking fired up for this one."

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.380
"C’mon Chad don’t be like that you f**ing mug, c’mon."

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:40.820
"Wow! Wow, family show."

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.620
"He cheated, it was not a fair game and you know it."

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.380
"Mate, have you seen what you’ve done to me the last two weeks."

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:52.240
"Look, act like a b**ch get treated like one, that’s all I'm gonna say."

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:56.800
"Woah, Chad what are you going to say to this."

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.980
"Look mate it's the caches, we won the cricket."

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:05.320
"Cricket? Nobody understands Cricket. You gotta know what a crumpet is to understand cricket."

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:10.800
"I know you and your little croneys over there have been working on your strategies every single night."

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:20.080
"You know what I brought with me, an official letter from Carmac, we’re playing Dust 2!"

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:24.620
"We’re taking it all, your strategies are gone, you’re all f**ked."

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:31.500
"So you guys look nice and fresh today, clothes are obviously very well ironed. You’re looking stunning up there."

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:35.100
"Thank you very much Jason, and I see you found that shirt I threw out when I was ten."

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:39.200
"Yeah, I did."

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.360
"That one hurt a little bit."

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.070
"I’ve been told to get rid of you, so that’s
An An and Mo Mo to cast this one."

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:48.240
"I think if I continue to throw enough sh-t
against the wall with my predictions eventually

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.640
one will stick, and it feels like this Mousesports
one is gonna be..."

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.640
"So you’re going to throw four of the Na`Vi
members against the wall?"

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.940
Well guys, that’s all we’ve got for you
on Best of this week.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:02.580
Now look, if your favourite get rekt clip
wasn’t in this compilation,

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:08.740
there's probably a good reason for that, but I know that’s not going to stop you from flaming us in the comments anyway.

